<section class="page-hero">
<div class="container">
<span class="hero-badge">Our Team</span>
<h1>Certified Environmental Inspectors</h1>
<p>Our inspectors hold current California certifications and follow EPA, AHERA, and Cal/OSHA standards for every inspection.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section>
<div class="container">
<div class="section-header">
<span>Leadership</span>
<h2>Experienced Environmental Professionals</h2>
<p>Every inspection is performed by a certified professional — never subcontracted. Our team brings decades of combined experience in environmental consulting, asbestos inspection, mold assessment, and indoor air quality testing.</p>
</div>

<div class="grid grid--3">

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">&#x1F3EB;</div>
<h3>Lead Inspector</h3>
<p><strong>Certifications:</strong> California CDPH Certified Lead Inspector, EPA RRP Certified, AHERA-accredited Asbestos Inspector</p>
<p><strong>Specializations:</strong> Lead-based paint inspections, lead risk assessments, pre-1978 property evaluations, dust wipe sampling, soil sampling</p>
<p><strong>Experience:</strong> Extensive experience with residential and commercial lead inspections throughout Southern California. Familiar with California Lead Compliance Program requirements and HUD lead-safe housing standards.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">&#x2696;&#xFE0F;</div>
<h3>Asbestos Inspector</h3>
<p><strong>Certifications:</strong> California CDPH Certified Asbestos Inspector, AHERA-accredited, NESHAP-trained</p>
<p><strong>Specializations:</strong> Asbestos building surveys, bulk sampling, AHERA re-inspections, pre-demolition surveys, operations &amp; maintenance programs</p>
<p><strong>Experience:</strong> Conducted thousands of asbestos inspections across residential, commercial, industrial, educational, and government facilities. Expertise in identifying asbestos-containing materials common to different construction eras.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">&#x1F3D8;&#xFE0F;</div>
<h3>Mold &amp; IAQ Specialist</h3>
<p><strong>Certifications:</strong> Certified Mold Inspector, Microbial Investigator, Indoor Air Quality Professional (CIQ)</p>
<p><strong>Specializations:</strong> Mold inspections, moisture investigations, indoor air quality assessments, air sampling, surface sampling, HVAC evaluations</p>
<p><strong>Experience:</strong> Specializes in moisture intrusion investigations and mold assessments for residential and commercial properties. Expertise in identifying moisture sources and assessing indoor environmental conditions.</p>
</div>

</div>

</div>
</section>

<section class="section light-section">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-header">
<span>Credentials</span>
<h2>Certifications &amp; Accreditations</h2>
<p>Our team maintains current certifications and follows industry standards for every inspection.</p>
</div>

<div class="grid grid--4">

<div class="cert-card">
<div class="icon">&#x1F4CB;</div>
<h3>CDPH Certified</h3>
<p>California Department of Public Health certified asbestos inspectors and lead inspectors/risk assessors</p>
</div>

<div class="cert-card">
<div class="icon">&#x1F3EB;</div>
<h3>AHERA Accredited</h3>
<p>EPA Asbestos Hazard Emergency Response Act accredited for school and commercial building inspections</p>
</div>

<div class="cert-card">
<div class="icon">&#x1F50D;</div>
<h3>NVLAP Labs</h3>
<p>Samples analyzed by National Voluntary Laboratory Accreditation Program accredited laboratories</p>
</div>

<div class="cert-card">
<div class="icon">&#x2696;&#xFE0F;</div>
<h3>EPA Certified</h3>
<p>EPA certified for asbestos and lead inspections under NESHAP, RRP, and AHERA regulations</p>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</section>

